WEBVTT

00:15:00.329 --> 00:15:04.704
But there's an important caveat, emotions
are data, they are not directives,

00:15:05.121 --> 00:15:07.162
we can show up, turn our emotions

00:15:07.162 --> 00:15:09.912
for their values without needing
to listen to them,

00:15:10.787 --> 00:15:15.704
just like I can show up to my son in his
frustration with his baby sister.

00:15:17.037 --> 00:15:19.787
But not endorse his idea that
he gets to give her away to

00:15:19.787 --> 00:15:25.287
the first stranger he sees in a shopping
mall. We own our emotions.

00:15:25.329 --> 00:15:30.329
They don't own us. When we internalize
the difference between how I feel